Scope
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository is a fork of Metaculus/metac-bot-template
(https://github.com/Metaculus/metac-bot-template). The upstream template has no
license file. Code and documentation that came from the upstream template
remain the property of Metaculus and its contributors and stay under whatever
terms Metaculus sets; this MIT license does NOT relicense them.

The MIT license above covers only the changes and additions made by Bryan Young
in this fork, including (non-exhaustively): the lanternbot/ package, tests/,
the LanternBot class, PrivateCommentMetaculusClient and the run logic in
main.py after the upstream SummerTemplateBot2026 class, and the lanternbot
edits to README.md, the workflow files, pyproject.toml and bot_helpers.py.
See NOTICE and the git history for exactly what changed.

The forecasting-tools library used by this bot is published by Metaculus
under the MIT license (https://github.com/Metaculus/forecasting-tools).
